After a relatively stable period, Sporkhack has updated to 6.3.  This
version will break saves; the public server at sporkhack.com has already
been updated.  I'm not sure when the nethack.alt.org version will be
changed over, but I suspect "soon, once we verify there are no explosive
bugs in this one".

There are far too many changes to list here, and many of them are in the
level compiler; the full changelog can be found, as always, at
http://www.sporkhack.com/.

Windows binaries have been compiled for this version and are ready to go.

